From 994f0811f94c18334d0f73c978e2d031c6475eb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dudua99 <99@9900.co.il>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:22:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unlink the Sfas Emes' father, R' Avraham Mordechai Alter,
 from his grandson the Imrei Emes (Q2623065)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Otzaria/otzaria#5593. Two claims name the father of the Sfas Emes (son of the Chiddushei
HaRim, 1816-1855, per the Wikipedia article of the Chiddushei HaRim) and were linked by name to
Q2623065, the Imrei Emes (1865/6-1948), who is the Sfas Emes' son:
- Q2891454 (Sfas Emes) family 'אביו': רבי אברהם מרדכי אלתר
- Q1810688 (Chiddushei HaRim) family 'בנו': רבי אברהם מרדכי אלתר
The registry has no entry for the father, so both are unlinked (null override). The Sfas Emes'
own son claim ('בנו ... בעל אמרי אמת') keeps its link.
---
 data/entries/Q1810688.json     | 3 +--
 data/entries/Q2891454.json     | 3 +--
 data/review/ref-overrides.json | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/review/ref-overrides.json

diff --git a/data/entries/Q1810688.json b/data/entries/Q1810688.json
index 31329361..26424ded 100644
--- a/data/entries/Q1810688.json
+++ b/data/entries/Q1810688.json
@@ -223,8 +223,7 @@
     },
     "src": [
      "wikipedia"
-    ],
-    "ref": "Q2623065"
+    ]
    },
    {
     "value": {
diff --git a/data/entries/Q2891454.json b/data/entries/Q2891454.json
index 58628cad..dfcb060f 100644
--- a/data/entries/Q2891454.json
+++ b/data/entries/Q2891454.json
@@ -177,8 +177,7 @@
     },
     "src": [
      "wikipedia"
-    ],
-    "ref": "Q2623065"
+    ]
    },
    {
     "value": {
diff --git a/data/review/ref-overrides.json b/data/review/ref-overrides.json
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..61c3a7e1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/data/review/ref-overrides.json
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+{
+ "Q1810688|family|רבי אברהם מרדכי אלתר": null,
+ "Q2891454|family|רבי אברהם מרדכי אלתר": null
+}
